coordinates     gas.xyz

#QM method
basis 6-31gs
method wb97xd3
##qmindices      qm.txt

##threspdp 1.0e-4 ##leaving this here

precision mixed
charge 0
spinmult 1
purify no
#dftgrid 1
maxit 200
##pcm cosmo
##epsilon 2.38

min_image       11
##min_tolerance   1e-3
##min_tolerance_e 1e-5
nstep           9999

gpus                 1
##ts_method neb_frozen
min_coordinates cartesian
run         minimize
end
